      "disposition": "WITHHOLD",
      "review_reason": "Historical concern recorded before the verified source/mapping correction in receipt issue751-313-235-stock-and-source-labels. The following quotation describes the archived row and owner, not the current corrected payload: Current other publishes source RAW_TEXT 5-didehydro-D-gluconate as a name of 5-dehydro-D-gluconate. The history asserts a typo without primary source recovery. A didehydro species is chemically distinct (CHEBI:11449 versus CHEBI:58143); recover the comma-containing source before re-grounding, and do not treat the fragment as a verified synonym. The corrected claim remains WITHHOLD pending fresh mapping-specific review. All remaining or unassessed identity, synonym, preparation, role and component concerns remain review obligations; in particular, no provisional role is approved by this correction. This provenance qualification retires no historical finding and adds no scientific approval.",
