      "IAO:0000115": [
        "Pyrrolidine in which the <em>pro</em>-<i>S</i> hydrogen at position 2 is substituted by a carboxylic acid group. <small>L</small>-Proline is the only one of the twenty DNA-encoded amino acids which has a secondary amino group α to the carboxyl group. It is an essential component of collagen and is important for proper functioning of joints and tendons. It also helps maintain and strengthen heart muscles."
